<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Contato</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <style>
    body { background: var(--bg-dark); color: white; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-alt); }
    .content-container { max-width: 500px; background: var(--glass-bg); padding: 40px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); width: 90%; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
    h1 { color: var(--accent-cyan); margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 2.5rem; }
    p { color: #cbd5e1; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="content-container">
    <h1>Contato</h1>
    <p>Tem dúvidas, sugestões ou encontrou algum problema no portal?</p>
    <p>Fale diretamente com o professor mantenedor do projeto.</p>
    
    <div style="margin: 30px 0; text-align: left;">
      <form action="https://formsubmit.co/fabio.marques@edu.campos.rj.gov.br" method="POST" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px;">
        <!-- Configurações do FormSubmit -->
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Novo contato do Portal de Atividades!">
        <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="true">
        <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="box">
        <!-- Substituir para a página do portal se desejar, ou deixar default -->
        
        <label style="font-weight: bold; color: var(--accent-cyan);">Seu Nome:</label>
        <input type="text" name="name" required style="padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; border: none; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: white;">
        
        <label style="font-weight: bold; color: var(--accent-cyan);">Seu E-mail:</label>
        <input type="email" name="email" required style="padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; border: none; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: white;">
        
        <label style="font-weight: bold; color: var(--accent-cyan);">Mensagem:</label>
        <textarea name="message" required rows="5" style="padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; border: none; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: white; resize: vertical;"></textarea>
        
        <button type="submit" style="padding: 12px; background: var(--accent-purple); color: white; border: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 10px;">Enviar Mensagem 🚀</button>
      </form>
    </div>

    <a href="/" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background: var(--accent-blue); color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold;">⬅ Voltar para o Início</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
